        <item>
            <title>0.14.77</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 14:11:59 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>138</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.77</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Downloading audio (or video) no longer takes over the whole window with a media player you can&#x27;t exit. Exports always save as a file now, instead of being rendered inline by the web view.</li>
<li>The &quot;Everything as one archive&quot; download option is hidden when there is only one thing to save (a zip of a single file just duplicated that option).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
